 "v":{"t":"list","i":[["🔗","A citation that leads nowhere"],["🔢","A precise number with no source"],["↔️","The answer disagrees with itself"],["📣","\"Definitely, clearly\" with nothing behind it"]]},
 "ex":"\"According to the 2023 Gartner Retail Index (p. 41), churn fell 23.7%.\" Real-sounding report, exact page, precise figure: three tells in one sentence. Open the report before using it.",
