 "v":{"t":"list","i":[["📊","Your own pilot's numbers"],["💸","What it costs"],["⚠️","Where it still fails"],["✍️","Which steps keep a human signature"],["🔁","Capacity moved to better work, not people replaced"]]},
 "ex":"\"In our six-week pilot, first-draft time fell from 50 to 15 minutes at about $40 a month. It still misreads scanned PDFs, so a reviewer signs every brief.\"",
